  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher cross‑border supply‑chain interdependence and reliance on common hardware/cloud providers increases operational and financial linkages so outages, breaches or sanctions at one node propagate rapidly across infrastructure, markets and governance, strengthening systemic coupling.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
