  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.68</data>
  <data key="d36">Stronger coupling between tech infrastructure, security incidents and markets raises the probability of fast, correlated shocks that market‑makers hedge against by widening spreads and reducing dealer inventory, materially degrading bond market liquidity.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_buildout_risks</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_repricing</data>
