  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Stronger coupling between cloud/financial/operational systems allows AI-driven failures or cyber operations to cascade into industrial control networks, producing larger, faster physical damage to critical infrastructure in the theatre.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_buildout_risks</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_security</data>
</edge>
