  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Stronger coupling between AI systems, infrastructure, financial networks, and security apparatus raises the probability that cyber incidents, outages, or market disruptions will cascade across borders and be attributed to adversaries, elevating high‑level strategic tensions between the US and China.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_buildout_risks</data>
