  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Repeated disruptions to commercial shipping delay delivery of GPUs, servers and other specialized AI hardware, forcing postponed training runs and curtailed capacity expansion which directly slows model capability improvement.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
