  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher frequency of shipping interruptions raises supply‑chain and delivery risk premiums (insurance, contingency costs) for data‑center and hardware projects, which reduces investor appetite and slows capital deployment into AI infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_conflict</data>
