  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Noticeable increases in commercial-shipping disruptions trigger near-term flight-to-quality behavior, driving net inflows into government bond funds and other fixed-income vehicles as investors seek safe assets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_conflict</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_repricing</data>
