  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained spikes and volatility in global oil prices quickly increase Russian hydrocarbon revenues and fiscal headroom, enabling faster hiring, contract‑soldier payments, weapons procurement and logistical sustainment that raise mobilisation levels.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_conflict</data>
