  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Reduced or disrupted Russian energy supplies raise demand for Gulf crude and refined products, tightening market margins and making global oil prices more sensitive to regional shocks (including Iran‑Gulf incidents), thereby increasing short‑term price volatility.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_security</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_gulf_conflict</data>
