  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher expected short‑term policy rates increase firms' near‑term financing and opportunity costs, prompting companies and labs to defer or scale back expensive multi‑week training runs and experimental compute allocations, slowing the pace of measurable model capability gains.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
