  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A sharp deterioration in sovereign and fixed-income liquidity forces institutional deleveraging and margin-driven selling that spills into commodity futures and over-the-counter oil markets, producing abrupt swings and higher short-term oil price volatility.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
